00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,840
So we are the bad guys?

571
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:50,140
(Is everyone a guilty person?)

572
00:21:50,140 --> 00:21:56,940
(Everyone at the zoo is guilty)

573
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:58,480
Maybe we were the ones

574
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,720
who abused these animals.

575
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:00,440
For example, you used to be

576
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:01,880
the one who abused that wolf.

577
00:22:03,120 --> 00:22:04,840
Maybe I was the one who abused dogs.

578
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:06,320
Because those animals died.

579
00:22:06,320 --> 00:22:07,360
(Capy, Woofy, Bunbun, Whaley)

580
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:08,920
So they turned us into them,

581
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:09,680
so we could...

582
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:11,000
Feel what they went through.

583
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:11,400
Right.

584
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:13,680
(Capy)
Capybara-type personality.

585
00:22:15,040 --> 00:22:16,720
(Woofy)
Good doggy-type employee.

586
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:19,320
(Bunbun)
Little white rabbit.

587
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:22,000
(Whaley)
Mermaid-type employee.

588
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:25,840
Yeah, we all abused the animals before.

589
00:22:26,280 --> 00:22:28,240
So he injected us with these things,

590
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,280
turning us into animals.

591
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:31,080
Then he abused us.

592
00:22:31,080 --> 00:22:33,160
(Their actions came back to haunt them)
20 hours of livestream interaction.

593
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:35,040
Any prank or teasing.

594
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:37,080
10 water shows every day.

595
00:22:37,280 --> 00:22:38,520
Electric shock correction.

596
00:22:38,540 --> 00:22:40,660
(Tui Haowan wants revenge
on the four who hurt animals)

597
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:42,520
This logic makes sense.

598
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:43,000
Right?

599
00:22:43,020 --> 00:22:44,460
(Theory: They were humans
who abused animals before)

600
00:22:44,460 --> 00:22:46,060
(Tui Haowan turned them into animals)

601
00:22:46,060 --> 00:22:47,700
(and abused them
to make them feel the same pain)

602
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:49,380
(This is a revenge against humans)

603
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:51,360
This is

604
00:22:52,080 --> 00:22:52,640
a revenge

605
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:54,800
against humans.

606
00:22:55,900 --> 00:22:58,740
(Humans, the four suspects)

607
00:22:58,780 --> 00:23:00,780
(Who is taking revenge on humans?)

608
00:23:01,380 --> 00:23:04,300
(Play bug activated)

609
00:23:04,820 --> 00:23:07,060
(A fake fishing scene)

610
00:23:07,060 --> 00:23:08,500
(New bonus scenes every Sunday at noon)

611
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:11,440
Why did it suddenly go up into the sky?

612
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:12,200
Come down.

613
00:23:12,220 --> 00:23:14,300
(Taking over the small hill)

614
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:16,320
That's more like it.

615
00:23:20,260 --> 00:23:21,660
(Fishing rod defense)

616
00:23:22,260 --> 00:23:23,980
(Shocked)

617
00:23:24,600 --> 00:23:25,280
What's wrong?

618
00:23:25,280 --> 00:23:26,360
You scared me.

619
00:23:26,360 --> 00:23:27,960
Don't scare me like that.

620
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:28,880
You scared me.

621
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:29,880
No.

622
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:30,480
You were right by my ear.

623
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:32,000
Sorry.

624
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:34,120
So now I know.

625
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:36,000
The one who's always
been afraid wasn't me.

626
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:38,960
Guys,

627
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:39,560
something happened.

628
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:40,200
What happened?

629
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:41,960
The person

630
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:43,800
we're supposed to punish today

631
00:23:43,800 --> 00:23:44,560
ran into a problem.

632
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:45,720
What problem?

633
00:23:45,720 --> 00:23:49,000
A human snuck into our group.

634
00:23:49,020 --> 00:23:50,820
(Human?)

635
00:23:50,820 --> 00:23:51,940
(Detective's alertness)
Oh my god!

636
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:52,880
This one.

637
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:53,360
Him.

638
00:23:53,360 --> 00:23:54,040
(It's you, isn't it?)
Him.

639
00:23:54,040 --> 00:23:54,680
It's him, right?

640
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:55,480
It's him.

641
00:23:55,960 --> 00:23:56,520
Search him.

642
00:23:56,520 --> 00:23:57,520
He's acting too suspicious.

643
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:58,360
I will...

644
00:23:58,360 --> 00:23:59,000
I'll punish him first.

645
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,060
(Take my hammer!)

646
00:24:02,020 --> 00:24:03,540
(Search)

647
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:04,520
Wait, everyone.

648
00:24:04,520 --> 00:24:06,240
(Everyone, calm down first)
I know you're angry.

649
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,240
But I have a way.

650
00:24:07,240 --> 00:24:07,920
What way?

651
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:08,560
Here.

652
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:10,160
There's a TV.

653
00:24:10,520 --> 00:24:12,360
Why is there human stuff here?

654
00:24:12,360 --> 00:24:13,180
(Strike first)

655
00:24:13,560 --> 00:24:14,840
This isn't a TV.

656
00:24:14,840 --> 00:24:17,040
It's a human detector mirror.

657
00:24:17,200 --> 00:24:18,000
A human detector mirror?

658
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:19,760
(Human detector mirror)
Yeah, just stand in front of it.

659
00:24:19,760 --> 00:24:22,360
Stand in front of it
and it'll show your true form.

660
00:24:22,360 --> 00:24:22,800
Right.

661
00:24:23,360 --> 00:24:24,840
Then we'll know who's human.

662
00:24:24,900 --> 00:24:26,900
(Such advanced technology)

663
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:28,320
I think I'll check

664
00:24:28,320 --> 00:24:30,080
this suspicious dobermann first.

665
00:24:30,080 --> 00:24:31,280
Sure, no problem.

666
00:24:31,280 --> 00:24:32,800
Come on, stand in front of it.

667
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,480
Okay.

668
00:24:34,280 --> 00:24:34,760
Me?

669
00:24:34,760 --> 00:24:35,240
Yeah.

670
00:24:43,920 --> 00:24:44,160
A real dog.

671
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:46,280
Isn't this my dog?

672
00:24:46,280 --> 00:24:47,200
Good boy.

673
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:48,000
I shouldn't have doubted you.

674
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:49,360
Come on, don't be mad. Get over here.

675
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:51,080
Go over there, good.

676
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:51,720
A real dog.

677
00:24:53,760 --> 00:24:55,400
If there's danger later,

678
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:56,280
run with me.

679
00:24:57,920 --> 00:24:59,120
Why are you talking to me?

680
00:25:00,320 --> 00:25:01,400
Try him.

681
00:25:01,420 --> 00:25:02,560
(He's suspicious)

682
00:25:02,560 --> 00:25:03,720
Go on.

683
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:05,160
Come on.

684
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:05,920
He's human too.

685
00:25:06,800 --> 00:25:07,640
Let's rule him out.

686
00:25:07,640 --> 00:25:10,060
(Will Bu Kakao be human?)

687
00:25:10,240 --> 00:25:10,800
He's human too.

688
00:25:16,060 --> 00:25:16,740
(Bu Kakao really is a dog)

689
00:25:16,760 --> 00:25:17,600
He really is one.

690
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:18,520
You're so cute.

691
00:25:18,520 --> 00:25:19,440
That's adorable.

692
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:20,080
(Changing face)
Why are you so cute?

693
00:25:20,140 --> 00:25:21,680
(We wronged you, little cutie)

694
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:23,560
How about you guys?

695
00:25:23,560 --> 00:25:24,760
Stand in front of it together.

696
00:25:24,760 --> 00:25:25,080
Come on.

697
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,600
Yeah, together, two rows.

698
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:28,480
Everyone needs to appear in the mirror.

699
00:25:29,040 --> 00:25:30,000
Come on, all together.

700
00:25:31,020 --> 00:25:32,060
(Taking photos with besties be like)

701
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:33,120
What does this mean?

702
00:25:33,120 --> 00:25:33,800
You're so pretty.

703
00:25:34,560 --> 00:25:36,160
Yeah, good. Amazing.

704
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:39,920
Everyone looks so good, so handsome.

705
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:41,680
Something's really wrong.

706
00:25:43,320 --> 00:25:43,600
What's wrong?

707
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:44,800
You're all human.

708
00:25:44,800 --> 00:25:45,480
No.

709
00:25:46,040 --> 00:25:47,400
It hasn't reacted yet.

710
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,800
Come on, I'll check again.

711
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:49,920
Wait.

712
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:57,120
We don't need to wait

713
00:25:57,120 --> 00:25:57,880
any longer.

714
00:25:58,320 --> 00:26:00,000
It's clear you're human.

715
00:26:00,760 --> 00:26:01,840
All six of us are human.

716
00:26:01,840 --> 00:26:03,500
(Confirmed: All six are human)

717
00:26:07,040 --> 00:26:08,040
So what if we're human?

718
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:10,400
I knew it.

719
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:12,280
Tui Haowan said four people
would be sent here

720
00:26:12,280 --> 00:26:13,440
for punishment today.

721
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:15,080
Who said that?

722
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:16,800
Tui Haowan.

723
00:26:16,820 --> 00:26:18,480
(Tui Haowan sent four humans
to the mysterious zone?)

724
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:19,520
Tui Haowan is already dead.

725
00:26:21,280 --> 00:26:22,160
Alright then.

726
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:24,360
Then I'll send you to Tui Haowan.

727
00:26:25,960 --> 00:26:26,400
No!

728
00:26:26,420 --> 00:26:27,640
(Oh no, this is bad)

729
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:28,360
Animals.

730
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:29,320
Yes!

731
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:30,200
No.

732
00:26:32,120 --> 00:26:35,280
Capture the animal most like humans.

733
00:26:35,300 --> 00:26:38,260
(The animal most like humans?)

734
00:26:38,280 --> 00:26:38,720
What are you doing?

735
00:26:40,320 --> 00:26:41,160
That's not what I meant.

736
00:26:41,160 --> 00:26:41,640
You guys.

737
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:42,960
Come here.

738
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:43,840
Come with me. This way.

739
00:26:43,840 --> 00:26:44,820
(There's a show to watch)

740
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:46,280
I'm not the one you're capturing.

741
00:26:46,800 --> 00:26:48,440
What kind of understanding is that?
Capture them!

742
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:49,200
Hurry, follow me.

743
00:26:49,760 --> 00:26:50,200
Run.

744
00:26:50,440 --> 00:26:51,640
Run, come on.

745
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:52,280
Go.

746
00:26:52,280 --> 00:26:52,960
Come with me.

747
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:54,360
Capture them!

748
00:26:54,360 --> 00:26:55,320
Let go.

749
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:56,640
Come on.

750
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:57,320
Hurry up!

751
00:26:57,320 --> 00:26:58,480
Run, hurry and run.

752
00:26:58,920 --> 00:26:59,280
Go.

753
00:27:04,320 --> 00:27:05,680
What does this mean?

754
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:07,040
What does that mean?

755
00:27:09,080 --> 00:27:09,840
Hurry, go.

756
00:27:12,120 --> 00:27:13,400
Go.

757
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:14,880
It's so beautiful.

758
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:16,640
It smells so good.

759
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:17,860
(New scene unlocked: Animal World)

760
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,280
The air feels fresher.

761
00:27:22,600 --> 00:27:23,240
Fox.

762
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:25,240
This is you.

763
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:28,080
Look.

764
00:27:29,520 --> 00:27:32,000
Show, Fight, Captivity, Training, Abuse.

765
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:35,600
Show. You turned our fear,

766
00:27:35,600 --> 00:27:37,560
our screams and struggles

767
00:27:37,560 --> 00:27:38,640
into videos.

768
00:27:38,640 --> 00:27:39,640
You watched us suffer

769
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:42,240
and said,

770
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:44,280
"This will definitely go viral."

771
00:27:44,280 --> 00:27:45,720
So this is animal abuse?

772
00:27:45,720 --> 00:27:45,960
Fight.

773
00:27:46,240 --> 00:27:48,120
You locked us in iron cages,

774
00:27:48,120 --> 00:27:50,000
forced us to tear each other apart.

775
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:51,000
We were the ones bleeding.

776
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:52,280
But you were the ones cheering.

777
00:27:53,560 --> 00:27:54,520
Captivity.

778
00:27:54,520 --> 00:27:56,800
You said you loved swans.

779
00:27:56,800 --> 00:27:58,400
So you cut off their flight feathers,

780
00:27:58,800 --> 00:28:01,160
keeping them trapped
in artificial lakes forever.

781
00:28:01,520 --> 00:28:04,040
You took their endless lives

782
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:07,400
and reduced them to a cage for display.

783
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:08,560
Training.

784
00:28:09,080 --> 00:28:11,520
Whips, pliers,
electric shocks, starvation.

785
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:13,920
You called torture "training"

786
00:28:13,920 --> 00:28:15,760
until we finally gave in.

787
00:28:15,760 --> 00:28:16,920
Not because we were tamed,

788
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:18,280
but because we knew

789
00:28:18,280 --> 00:28:19,680
resisting would hurt even more.

790
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:22,280
They ripped out our fur,

791
00:28:22,280 --> 00:28:23,720
cut off our limbs,

792
00:28:23,720 --> 00:28:25,880
burned us, shocked us, buried us alive.

793
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:27,920
Then casually said,

794
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:28,600
"It is"

795
00:28:28,600 --> 00:28:30,920
"just an animal."

796
00:28:30,980 --> 00:28:32,460
(It is just an animal)

797
00:28:33,200 --> 00:28:33,760
That's...

798
00:28:34,160 --> 00:28:35,720
What right do we have to say this?

799
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:36,680
We are all human.

800
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:38,640
But I never did these things.

801
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:39,640
I never did them either.

802
00:28:39,660 --> 00:28:42,940
(What do these slogans have
to do with them?)

803
00:28:43,760 --> 00:28:44,600
Wait.

804
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:46,080
Everyone.

805
00:28:49,040 --> 00:28:51,240
A typical person being punished.

806
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:52,320
(A typical person being punished)

807
00:28:52,320 --> 00:28:53,640
Tui City Zoo.

808
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:57,200
Grandpa Ding, Aunt Jin, Uncle Ke,

809
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:59,480
Mommy Nan, and Daddy He.

810
00:28:59,480 --> 00:29:00,800
Mommy Nan, Daddy He.

811
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:02,760
Wait.

812
00:29:03,320 --> 00:29:03,920
Move aside.

813
00:29:03,920 --> 00:29:04,440
Get down.

814
00:29:04,920 --> 00:29:05,520
What's wrong?

815
00:29:05,520 --> 00:29:05,960
Get down.

816
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:07,200
(Highest seniority in the group)
You're Grandpa now.

817
00:29:07,200 --> 00:29:07,720
Get down.

818
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:08,640
I'm the ancestor.

819
00:29:09,600 --> 00:29:09,920
Get down.

820
00:29:11,220 --> 00:29:12,740
(Daddy He, Grandpa Ding)

821
00:29:12,980 --> 00:29:13,660
(A junior)

822
00:29:13,960 --> 00:29:14,840
Oh, he's Grandpa Ding.

823
00:29:15,380 --> 00:29:16,780
(Generations doubled)

824
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:18,200
I'm your...

825
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:19,320
Whose dad am I?

826
00:29:20,140 --> 00:29:21,860
(The question nobody wants to answer)

827
00:29:22,240 --> 00:29:23,120
You are...

828
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:26,320
(Your dad)
You're He's dad.

829
00:29:26,320 --> 00:29:28,280
You're Mommy Nan's dad.

830
00:29:28,280 --> 00:29:29,560
(Your dad)
You're Daddy He.

831
00:29:29,560 --> 00:29:31,520
Yes, he's the dad of all four of you.

832
00:29:31,520 --> 00:29:32,140
(All are his sons)

833
00:29:34,200 --> 00:29:35,400
If that's true,

834
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:37,280
you're their kid?

835
00:29:41,520 --> 00:29:43,240
My son.

836
00:29:45,040 --> 00:29:45,520
No.

837
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,200
No, I'm the child

838
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:50,080
of the neighbor, Mr. Bai.

839
00:29:51,760 --> 00:29:52,680
Mr. Bai.

840
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:53,760
My grandson.

841
00:29:54,360 --> 00:29:55,640
I only acknowledge this grandpa.

842
00:29:55,640 --> 00:29:56,600
I don't recognize anyone else.

843
00:29:57,780 --> 00:29:59,100
(Finally satisfied)

844
00:29:59,120 --> 00:29:59,760
Alright.

845
00:29:59,760 --> 00:30:01,000
What he means is

846
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,080
this zoo

847
00:30:02,080 --> 00:30:03,560
was originally run by us.

848
00:30:03,560 --> 00:30:05,760
We were the ones doing all this.

849
00:30:05,780 --> 00:30:07,980
(So we were abusing animals?)

850
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,400
Our ancestors.

851
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:10,240
That's us.

852
00:30:11,760 --> 00:30:12,520
Us.

853
00:30:13,360 --> 00:30:14,480
Tui City Zoo.

854
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:16,320
We are the bad guys.

855
00:30:17,400 --> 00:30:18,560
The logic we mentioned earlier is right.

856
00:30:18,560 --> 00:30:18,920
Right.

857
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:20,120
So that's how it is.

858
00:30:20,120 --> 00:30:22,040
We were the ones
