01:20:30,240 --> 01:20:31,600
I chose him.

2481
01:20:31,600 --> 01:20:32,200
You chose him?

2482
01:20:34,040 --> 01:20:34,880
Maybe you were right.

2483
01:20:36,340 --> 01:20:37,220
(Is He Struggle the killer?)

2484
01:20:37,240 --> 01:20:38,120
They are

2485
01:20:38,760 --> 01:20:39,590
(Vote result one: He Struggle)
He Struggle

2486
01:20:39,920 --> 01:20:41,040
(Vote result two: Jin Goofy)
and Jin Goofy.

2487
01:20:41,040 --> 01:20:42,800
Suspects, come forward.

2488
01:20:42,800 --> 01:20:43,080
Okay.

2489
01:20:43,680 --> 01:20:45,360
The classic "pick one" dilemma.

2490
01:20:45,680 --> 01:20:46,320
Let's do this.

2491
01:20:46,800 --> 01:20:48,040
You stand with your bestie.

2492
01:20:48,040 --> 01:20:49,400
My girlfriend.

2493
01:20:49,400 --> 01:20:49,760
Girlfriend.

2494
01:20:50,160 --> 01:20:51,840
The three of us will stand behind him.

2495
01:20:51,840 --> 01:20:52,320
If it's him,

2496
01:20:52,320 --> 01:20:54,240
(Talking won't work-use force)
then we'll kick him out.

2497
01:20:54,240 --> 01:20:55,480
Stay ready. Come on.

2498
01:20:56,280 --> 01:20:57,000
I really...

2499
01:20:57,920 --> 01:20:59,240
Go ahead, kick me.

2500
01:20:59,600 --> 01:21:00,120
Be ready.

2501
01:21:00,120 --> 01:21:01,040
If you vote wrong, kick me.

2502
01:21:01,600 --> 01:21:03,360
Let's see if you can catch me today.

2503
01:21:03,360 --> 01:21:04,440
Deal, Nan?

2504
01:21:04,440 --> 01:21:05,480
(Is Jin Goofy the killer?)
Deal?

2505
01:21:05,480 --> 01:21:07,720
The suspect with the most votes is...

2506
01:21:13,040 --> 01:21:13,800
Jin Goofy.

2507
01:21:17,160 --> 01:21:17,600
No way.

2508
01:21:18,680 --> 01:21:20,800
(Voting round)
Putting motive aside,

2509
01:21:20,800 --> 01:21:22,360
I think everyone had one.

2510
01:21:22,360 --> 01:21:24,240
So

2511
01:21:24,240 --> 01:21:26,120
I'm going with my gut.

2512
01:21:26,760 --> 01:21:27,520
He Struggle.

2513
01:21:28,640 --> 01:21:29,040
Okay.

2514
01:21:29,040 --> 01:21:30,120
(Voting: He Struggle)

2515
01:21:30,120 --> 01:21:30,800
This is tough.

2516
01:21:32,040 --> 01:21:34,720
I'm still casting my vote for

2517
01:21:34,720 --> 01:21:36,160
(Voting: Jin Goofy)
my dearest sister.

2518
01:21:36,720 --> 01:21:38,440
In the end, we narrowed it down

2519
01:21:39,040 --> 01:21:40,120
using two lines of reasoning.

2520
01:21:40,120 --> 01:21:42,000
The suspects came down to

2521
01:21:42,000 --> 01:21:43,360
He and Jin.

2522
01:21:43,800 --> 01:21:46,240
I chose to trust

2523
01:21:46,240 --> 01:21:48,520
the kinder, gentler

2524
01:21:48,520 --> 01:21:49,240
capybara.

2525
01:21:50,440 --> 01:21:53,080
I voted for Jin Goofy.

2526
01:21:53,080 --> 01:21:55,720
First, she had the strongest motive.

2527
01:21:55,720 --> 01:21:57,280
Second, she had enough time

2528
01:21:57,280 --> 01:22:00,760
to get near the boss's room.

2529
01:22:00,760 --> 01:22:03,120
Third,

2530
01:22:03,120 --> 01:22:03,760
her family ties.

2531
01:22:03,760 --> 01:22:06,240
Her own younger brother
was one of the victims.

2532
01:22:06,240 --> 01:22:07,040
That's why I voted for her.

2533
01:22:07,040 --> 01:22:07,900
(Voting: Jin Goofy)

2534
01:22:08,060 --> 01:22:08,900
(Vote Result, Pattern 1: Jin Goofy)

2535
01:22:08,900 --> 01:22:09,740
(Ning Watcha, He Struggle,
Ding Staring, Ke Uh-Oh)

2536
01:22:09,740 --> 01:22:10,540
(Vote Pattern 2: He Struggle)

2537
01:22:10,540 --> 01:22:11,260
(Jin Goofy, Nan Shy)

2538
01:22:11,680 --> 01:22:13,240
Never give up until the very end.

2539
01:22:13,440 --> 01:22:14,400
Longdong Army spirit.

2540
01:22:14,400 --> 01:22:15,440
Alright, Longdong Army spirit.

2541
01:22:15,440 --> 01:22:16,040
The Longdong effect.

2542
01:22:16,040 --> 01:22:16,640
Longdong Army.

2543
01:22:16,640 --> 01:22:18,000
When the Longdong Army arrives... kick!

2544
01:22:18,000 --> 01:22:18,600
Alright.

2545
01:22:21,240 --> 01:22:22,320
(Protective stance)
Alright, come on.

2546
01:22:23,160 --> 01:22:25,360
Now we'll reveal
whether you've caught the killer...

2547
01:22:31,240 --> 01:22:33,040
or not.

2548
01:22:33,540 --> 01:22:34,300
(Almost kicked him)

2549
01:22:36,320 --> 01:22:37,560
I was just about to kick him.

2550
01:22:37,560 --> 01:22:38,240
Sorry.

2551
01:22:38,240 --> 01:22:38,760
Okay.

2552
01:22:38,760 --> 01:22:39,480
I already lifted my leg.

2553
01:22:39,480 --> 01:22:40,760
Yeah, I did. Sorry.

2554
01:22:40,760 --> 01:22:42,700
(Ready to stop them)

2555
01:22:43,360 --> 01:22:45,320
Wait, weren't you
only kicking me if you lost?

2556
01:22:45,320 --> 01:22:46,320
(Every Thursday noon, Dungeon Archiving)
Yeah.

2557
01:22:46,320 --> 01:22:47,200
(Uncover the story behind the scenes)
Because they didn't vote for you.

2558
01:22:47,200 --> 01:22:48,480
They all voted for me.

2559
01:22:48,480 --> 01:22:49,440
No.

2560
01:22:49,440 --> 01:22:51,160
We'll only kick you if we lose.

2561
01:22:51,160 --> 01:22:52,240
Don't worry, we won't.

2562
01:22:52,240 --> 01:22:52,960
(I'm not that petty)
Do I look like that?

2563
01:22:53,480 --> 01:22:54,840
The culprit identification
for this case...

2564
01:23:01,080 --> 01:23:01,840
was successful.

2565
01:23:04,380 --> 01:23:05,740
(Killer identified)

2566
01:23:05,740 --> 01:23:06,820
(Ding Staring, Ning Watcha,
He Yiwei, Ke Uh-Oh)

2567
01:23:06,820 --> 01:23:07,880
(The killer)

2568
01:23:07,880 --> 01:23:09,120
Longdong Army!

2569
01:23:09,120 --> 01:23:11,360
(Victory)
Longdong Army!

2570
01:23:11,360 --> 01:23:14,460
(Cheering)
Longdong Army!

2571
01:23:14,560 --> 01:23:16,680
So it was you?

2572
01:23:16,680 --> 01:23:17,720
Yes.

2573
01:23:19,600 --> 01:23:20,840
You were the only one who voted wrong.

2574
01:23:20,840 --> 01:23:21,600
(My dear bestie, how could you do this?)

2575
01:23:21,600 --> 01:23:22,400
My dear best...

2576
01:23:22,400 --> 01:23:24,000
I was too foolish!

2577
01:23:24,200 --> 01:23:25,280
You played really well, honestly.

2578
01:23:25,800 --> 01:23:27,080
No, you really did great.

2579
01:23:27,280 --> 01:23:28,760
It was just sisterly affection.

2580
01:23:28,760 --> 01:23:31,580
(That hurt me deeply.)

2581
01:23:31,600 --> 01:23:33,040
But what does this prove?

2582
01:23:33,040 --> 01:23:34,560
Our Longdong Army.

2583
01:23:35,560 --> 01:23:37,320
Our Longdong Army.

2584
01:23:37,320 --> 01:23:38,680
It's still united.

2585
01:23:38,680 --> 01:23:39,760
The brothers' efforts were not in vain.

2586
01:23:40,560 --> 01:23:42,520
Today, we upheld the pride
of the Longdong Army.

2587
01:23:43,400 --> 01:23:45,080
So, when did you commit the crime?

2588
01:23:45,300 --> 01:23:46,660
(How did Jin Goofy do it?)

2589
01:23:46,920 --> 01:23:47,800
Yes, I want to know too.

2590
01:23:47,800 --> 01:23:49,360
It was just as you all suspected.

2591
01:23:49,600 --> 01:23:51,080
The key evidence you missed was...

2592
01:23:52,640 --> 01:23:54,120
It was actually right near you.

2593
01:23:54,120 --> 01:23:55,000
Really?

2594
01:23:55,000 --> 01:23:55,580
(Again? We were close again?)

2595
01:23:56,160 --> 01:23:57,480
It was in the Human Resources
Office of Jin Goofy.

2596
01:23:57,480 --> 01:23:58,880
Behind the drawer
was a piece of torn cloth.

2597
01:23:58,880 --> 01:24:00,340
(Location of the key evidence)

2598
01:24:01,800 --> 01:24:03,400
It had traces of Melt-Away

2599
01:24:03,400 --> 01:24:04,920
and strong sulfuric acid.

2600
01:24:06,400 --> 01:24:07,680
It proved that she had tested

2601
01:24:07,680 --> 01:24:09,160
how strong its corrosive effect was.

2602
01:24:10,960 --> 01:24:12,520
Ding Staring was very close.

2603
01:24:13,280 --> 01:24:14,040
You almost got it.

2604
01:24:14,440 --> 01:24:16,000
It's you again.

2605
01:24:17,320 --> 01:24:18,800
No, I was being interviewed just now.

2606
01:24:18,800 --> 01:24:20,800
Meanwhile,
he was still searching your room.

2607
01:24:20,800 --> 01:24:22,760
I had already pulled out two drawers.

2608
01:24:23,120 --> 01:24:24,200
I suspected her,

2609
01:24:24,200 --> 01:24:25,880
so I came here to look around.

2610
01:24:25,880 --> 01:24:26,400
Okay, let's see.

2611
01:24:26,400 --> 01:24:27,860
(Final evidence search)

2612
01:24:31,900 --> 01:24:33,700
(Leaving no detail unchecked)

2613
01:24:39,240 --> 01:24:41,520
I feel like I was so close

2614
01:24:41,520 --> 01:24:42,680
to the key evidence today.

2615
01:24:42,680 --> 01:24:45,060
(Missed the crucial clue again)

2616
01:24:45,480 --> 01:24:46,400
But you didn't find it.

2617
01:24:46,660 --> 01:24:47,840
(I've missed the key
evidence so many times.)

2618
01:24:47,840 --> 01:24:48,840
Didn't see it.

2619
01:24:48,840 --> 01:24:50,760
Why are you always so close?

2620
01:24:50,760 --> 01:24:51,600
Exactly.

2621
01:24:53,340 --> 01:24:54,260
(Search for evidence is never easy)

2622
01:24:54,440 --> 01:24:56,240
The Truth Online has released a notice.

2623
01:24:57,120 --> 01:24:58,920
Players who failed
to identify the culprit

2624
01:24:58,920 --> 01:25:01,360
must recreate and film a cute pet meme.

2625
01:25:02,360 --> 01:25:03,760
On the day this case is released,

2626
01:25:04,280 --> 01:25:05,800
failed players must post

2627
01:25:05,800 --> 01:25:07,760
the meme on Weibo.

2628
01:25:08,200 --> 01:25:09,920
Today's participants are

2629
01:25:09,920 --> 01:25:11,800
Nan Shy and Jin Goofy.

2630
01:25:12,400 --> 01:25:13,680
Are you doing it with me?

2631
01:25:13,680 --> 01:25:14,080
Yes.

2632
01:25:14,480 --> 01:25:15,640
Why do I have to do it with you?

2633
01:25:15,640 --> 01:25:16,600
Because I lost too.

2634
01:25:16,600 --> 01:25:17,720
She was exposed by us.

2635
01:25:17,720 --> 01:25:18,840
I got caught.

2636
01:25:18,840 --> 01:25:19,720
It's because you two are best friends,

2637
01:25:19,720 --> 01:25:21,160
so you both lost today.

2638
01:25:24,880 --> 01:25:25,120
Here.

2639
01:25:25,120 --> 01:25:25,800
Coming.

2640
01:25:27,840 --> 01:25:28,640
What pose should I do?

2641
01:25:29,040 --> 01:25:29,560
Happy.

2642
01:25:30,920 --> 01:25:32,200
You're pretty happy about this.

2643
01:25:37,820 --> 01:25:39,380
(But bestie, I'm a little upset.)
Ah!

2644
01:25:39,400 --> 01:25:40,360
Thank you, Nan.

2645
01:25:40,360 --> 01:25:41,920
Otherwise, I would've been caught
by everyone today.

2646
01:25:41,920 --> 01:25:42,640
That would've been so embarrassing.

2647
01:25:42,640 --> 01:25:44,380
(A truly supportive friend)

2648
01:25:44,900 --> 01:25:45,680
Ah!

2649
01:25:45,680 --> 01:25:47,120
Okay, it's fine.

2650
01:25:47,120 --> 01:25:48,160
Dungeon Four:

2651
01:25:48,160 --> 01:25:49,320
Crazy Animal Theme Party

2652
01:25:49,320 --> 01:25:50,640
has encountered a game bug.

2653
01:25:52,600 --> 01:25:53,360
What happened?

2654
01:25:54,000 --> 01:25:54,760
What's going on?

2655
01:25:56,960 --> 01:25:58,160
Why were we teleported

2656
01:25:58,160 --> 01:25:58,960
back to the game lobby?

2657
01:25:59,200 --> 01:25:59,520
How?

2658
01:26:00,040 --> 01:26:01,520
The moment the lights went out,
we ended up here.

2659
01:26:01,760 --> 01:26:04,360
How many cases
does one dungeon usually have?

2660
01:26:05,200 --> 01:26:06,360
Normally, there are two or three cases.

2661
01:26:06,360 --> 01:26:07,680
But we came back after just one.

2662
01:26:07,960 --> 01:26:08,440
Yeah.

2663
01:26:08,440 --> 01:26:09,400
Why?

2664
01:26:09,400 --> 01:26:09,840
I don't know.

2665
01:26:10,020 --> 01:26:12,380
(Why were players sent back
to the game lobby?)

2666
01:26:12,760 --> 01:26:13,840
Can we check the rankings

2667
01:26:13,840 --> 01:26:15,080
for our Golden Keys?

2668
01:26:15,080 --> 01:26:16,800
(You're really career-minded)

2669
01:26:16,800 --> 01:26:17,400
We can.

2670
01:26:17,400 --> 01:26:18,280
But it's not urgent right now.

2671
01:26:18,280 --> 01:26:19,800
I don't think the Golden Keys matter.

2672
01:26:19,800 --> 01:26:21,280
Because I think they can all be reset.

2673
01:26:21,280 --> 01:26:23,740
No.

2674
01:26:23,840 --> 01:26:24,080
Right.

2675
01:26:24,600 --> 01:26:25,880
Past achievements are still saved.

2676
01:26:25,880 --> 01:26:26,920
But it seems like

2677
01:26:26,920 --> 01:26:28,000
there was some kind of bug.

2678
01:26:28,960 --> 01:26:29,960
Why are there so many bugs?

2679
01:26:29,960 --> 01:26:32,020
(Why does The Truth still have bugs?)

2680
01:26:34,860 --> 01:26:36,060
(A masked person appears)

2681
01:26:36,080 --> 01:26:37,360
You scared me!

2682
01:26:37,480 --> 01:26:38,920
You gave me a shock.

2683
01:26:39,100 --> 01:26:40,860
(Scaring people is even scarier)

2684
01:26:40,880 --> 01:26:41,800
Time rewinds.

2685
01:26:41,800 --> 01:26:42,880
The truth is revealed.

2686
01:26:42,880 --> 01:26:45,200
I am Wang Mian,
the agent of the God of Time.

2687
01:26:45,200 --> 01:26:46,600
As the captain of the Masked Team,

2688
01:26:46,600 --> 01:26:48,760
time is not merely the marks on a clock.

2689
01:26:48,760 --> 01:26:51,040
It is also the blade
and path I use to change fate.

2690
01:26:51,040 --> 01:26:51,800
So, murderer...

2691
01:26:52,200 --> 01:26:54,120
You won't get away this time.

2692
01:26:58,040 --> 01:26:58,520
What's going on?

2693
01:26:58,960 --> 01:26:59,680
How did I end up here?

2694
01:27:00,160 --> 01:27:01,480
I know him.

2695
01:27:01,480 --> 01:27:02,440
I know him too.

2696
01:27:02,440 --> 01:27:03,200
Li Fei.

2697
01:27:03,200 --> 01:27:03,760
Isn't he...

2698
01:27:04,120 --> 01:27:04,800
Li Fei.

2699
01:27:04,800 --> 01:27:05,700
(Why did Li Fei appear?)

2700
01:27:06,000 --> 01:27:07,600
Wait, I was just in Dungeon Four,

2701
01:27:07,600 --> 01:27:09,920
participating in the Animal
Bureau themed event.

2702
01:27:11,160 --> 01:27:12,240
(Li Zi Li, Animal Bureau's Director)
What event?

2703
01:27:12,760 --> 01:27:14,280
I was participating in

2704
01:27:14,280 --> 01:27:15,640
Animal Bureau's most popular anime,

2705
01:27:15,920 --> 01:27:17,320
Slay the Gods S2.

2706
01:27:18,960 --> 01:27:20,960
I was imitating the Time Master,
Wang Mian.

2707
01:27:22,200 --> 01:27:23,480
Your imitation is so accurate.

2708
01:27:23,480 --> 01:27:24,360
(Unexpected praise)
Right?

2709
01:27:24,920 --> 01:27:26,040
It looks really cool.

2710
01:27:26,040 --> 01:27:26,960
Really cool.

2711
01:27:26,960 --> 01:27:27,360
Barrier.

2712
01:27:28,520 --> 01:27:29,920
This hairstyle actually suits you.

2713
01:27:29,920 --> 01:27:30,640
Right?

2714
01:27:30,640 --> 01:27:31,000
Very handsome.

2715
01:27:31,000 --> 01:27:31,480
Right?

2716
01:27:31,700 --> 01:27:33,160
(Pretty good, bro)

2717
01:27:33,160 --> 01:27:33,720
So what happened?

2718
01:27:33,720 --> 01:27:34,240
I don't know either.

2719
01:27:34,240 --> 01:27:35,320
I was also thrown in here.

2720
01:27:35,520 --> 01:27:36,560
You were thrown in too?

2721
01:27:36,900 --> 01:27:38,340
(Why were all players
sent back to the game lobby?)

2722
01:27:38,560 --> 01:27:39,880
Who's going to fix this?

2723
01:27:40,640 --> 01:27:42,200
The thing is,
why did our clothes change too?

2724
01:27:42,200 --> 01:27:42,440
Yeah.

2725
01:27:43,000 --> 01:27:43,440
Our clothes changed as well.

2726
01:27:43,440 --> 01:27:43,960
Exactly.

2727
01:27:44,020 --> 01:27:45,640
(Why were players given new skins?)

2728
01:27:45,640 --> 01:27:47,040
Why are you all dressed so stylishly?

2729
01:27:47,480 --> 01:27:48,320
(Suddenly complimenting everyone)
You look so good.

2730
01:27:48,520 --> 01:27:49,360
Aren't you...

2731
01:27:49,360 --> 01:27:50,640
Why are you dressed
so revealingly today?

2732
01:27:52,600 --> 01:27:52,960
Really?

2733
01:27:52,960 --> 01:27:53,480
Is it that revealing?

2734
01:27:53,880 --> 01:27:55,280
I thought I was almost
not wearing anything just now.

2735
01:27:55,280 --> 01:27:55,760
Today is...

2736
01:27:56,360 --> 01:27:56,640
Yeah.

2737
01:27:58,160 --> 01:27:58,760
(Amid the chaos)
Everyone looks great.

2738
01:27:58,760 --> 01:27:59,600
(Collective affirmation achieved)
Alright.

2739
01:28:02,040 --> 01:28:02,880
This handsome guy...

2740
01:28:02,880 --> 01:28:04,320
Players, we finally meet.

2741
01:28:05,480 --> 01:28:05,880
He...

2742
01:28:05,880 --> 01:28:07,280
You're Bai?

2743
01:28:07,280 --> 01:28:09,080
Designer Bai?

2744
01:28:09,080 --> 01:28:09,720
Sorry.

2745
01:28:09,720 --> 01:28:10,680
(Designer Bai, played by Bai Qi Chen)
Finally, we meet.

2746
01:28:10,680 --> 01:28:11,560
(Star employee: Designer Bai)
I'm Designer Bai.

2747
01:28:11,560 --> 01:28:12,080
Nice to meet you.

2748
01:28:12,600 --> 01:28:13,480
I'm really sorry.

2749
01:28:13,480 --> 01:28:15,120
Our game has encountered another bug.

2750
01:28:16,200 --> 01:28:17,640
Why are there so many bugs?

2751
01:28:17,640 --> 01:28:18,400
