2765
01:28:36,200 --> 01:28:37,280
Okay.

2766
01:28:37,280 --> 01:28:39,040
Once I fix the bugs,

2767
01:28:39,040 --> 01:28:40,080
I'll take you back

2768
01:28:40,080 --> 01:28:41,200
