2815
01:30:24,400 --> 01:30:26,240
All lives are equal.

2816
01:30:27,040 --> 01:30:29,440
Every life deserves respect.

2817
01:30:29,440 --> 01:30:30,360
No one

2818
01:30:30,360 --> 01:30:31,400
