2828
01:30:49,320 --> 01:30:51,320
Humans need to learn empathy and see
things from others' perspectives.

2829
01:30:51,320 --> 01:30:52,720
Then I truly deserve to die.

2830
01:30:52,720 --> 01:30:53,680
You hurt him.

2831
01:30:54,320 --> 01:30:56,200
Before making different choices,

2832
01:30:56,200 --> 01:30:57,280
