2931
01:33:34,280 --> 01:33:36,080
so they can have
a better quality of life.

2932
01:33:36,080 --> 01:33:37,680
We must be responsible for them.

2933
01:33:37,680 --> 01:33:38,800
Since humans

2934
01:33:38,800 --> 01:33:40,520
are the more

2935
