3027
01:36:00,240 --> 01:36:01,320
Designer Bai was killed by

3028
01:36:01,320 --> 01:36:02,040
Loading.

3029
01:36:02,040 --> 01:36:03,040
And Loading

3030
01:36:03,040 --> 01:36:04,400
is one of you.

3031
01:36:04,400 --> 01:36:05,680
(Memories reshuffled. No trace remains.)

3032
01:36:05,680 --> 01:36:07,120
We must enter

3033
01:36:07,120 --> 01:36:09,760
each person's memory fragments.

3034
01:36:09,760 --> 01:36:11,280
Look for bugs

3035
01:36:11,280 --> 01:36:11,880
hidden within those memories.

3036
01:36:11,880 --> 01:36:13,600
The Memory Gate is open.

3037
01:36:13,600 --> 01:36:14,800
Players, please disembark.

3038
01:36:14,800 --> 01:36:15,480
What does that mean?

3039
01:36:15,480 --> 01:36:16,160
A life review?

3040
01:36:16,160 --> 01:36:17,240
Why

3041
01:36:17,240 --> 01:36:19,240
don't we remember any of this?

3042
01:36:19,240 --> 01:36:20,720
By uploading ourselves
from different points in time,

3043
01:36:20,720 --> 01:36:22,280
we can create different players.

3044
01:36:22,280 --> 01:36:23,240
Our personalities were split.

3045
01:36:23,240 --> 01:36:23,800
It's possible

3046
01:36:23,800 --> 01:36:25,320
we're all the same person.

3047
01:36:25,320 --> 01:36:26,200
We're all Loading.

3048
01:36:26,200 --> 01:36:27,000
We're five personalities

3049
01:36:27,000 --> 01:36:28,600
split from the same person.

3050
01:36:28,600 --> 01:36:29,840
Could Designer Bai

3051
01:36:29,840 --> 01:36:31,040
have been killed by all of us together?

3052
01:36:31,040 --> 01:36:32,440
(Trapped in the web. Find a way out.)

3053
01:36:32,440 --> 01:36:34,480
You're never getting back
to the real world.

3054
01:36:34,480 --> 01:36:36,360
One of you wants

3055
01:36:36,360 --> 01:36:37,360
to keep everyone trapped

3056
01:36:37,360 --> 01:36:38,680
inside the world of Truth.

3057
01:36:38,680 --> 01:36:39,520
The Eraser.

3058
01:36:39,520 --> 01:36:40,280
ESC.

3059
01:36:40,280 --> 01:36:41,560
ESC is the culprit.

3060
01:36:41,560 --> 01:36:42,920
You must enter

3061
01:36:42,920 --> 01:36:45,200
ESC's deepest memories.

3062
01:36:45,200 --> 01:36:46,280
Someone's sabotaging us.

3063
01:36:46,280 --> 01:36:47,600
And you're questioning me?

3064
01:36:47,600 --> 01:36:48,960
Those two are the most suspicious.

3065
01:36:48,960 --> 01:36:50,400
I've always wanted to play the killer.

3066
01:36:50,400 --> 01:36:51,120
He's definitely guilty.

3067
01:36:51,120 --> 01:36:52,160
I'm telling you, he's bad news.

3068
01:36:52,160 --> 01:36:53,640
Do you really
have to make it that obvious?

3069
01:36:53,640 --> 01:36:54,520
Trying to play mind games?

3070
01:36:54,520 --> 01:36:55,440
You keep accusing everyone else.

3071
01:36:55,440 --> 01:36:56,120
You're acting very suspicious today.

3072
01:36:56,120 --> 01:36:57,480
Now you're stuck defending yourself.

3073
01:36:57,480 --> 01:36:59,000
The stage is set.

3074
01:36:59,000 --> 01:37:00,560
You two.

3075
01:37:00,560 --> 01:37:01,760
Go ahead and perform.

3076
01:37:03,260 --> 01:37:06,340
(The Truth of Truth, Final Chapter)

3077
01:37:06,360 --> 01:37:07,680
(Dungeon Archive)
I am the murderer of this case.

3078
01:37:07,680 --> 01:37:08,460
(Jin Goofy)

3079
01:37:08,460 --> 01:37:08,920
(Talent hub)

3080
01:37:08,920 --> 01:37:10,120
(SVIP, every Thursday at noon.)
At this company,

3081
01:37:10,120 --> 01:37:11,360
(VIP, next day at noon)
my brother and I both

3082
01:37:11,360 --> 01:37:13,400
suffered torment from Tui Haowan.

3083
01:37:13,400 --> 01:37:14,360
We couldn't escape.

3084
01:37:14,360 --> 01:37:15,040
We had no way out.

3085
01:37:15,520 --> 01:37:16,520
The only way

3086
01:37:16,520 --> 01:37:17,760
was to kill him

3087
01:37:17,760 --> 01:37:19,080
and start a new life.

3088
01:37:19,080 --> 01:37:20,320
(Truth Clubhouse)
This wolf of yours is kind of cute.

3089
01:37:20,320 --> 01:37:21,500
Can you keep your subordinates in line?

3090
01:37:21,500 --> 01:37:22,080
(He's stunned)

3091
01:37:22,080 --> 01:37:23,280
I'm shocked, bro.

3092
01:37:23,280 --> 01:37:24,560
(Mickey Mouse Clubhouse version)
What kind of performance is this?

3093
01:37:24,560 --> 01:37:26,520
(Immersive investigation)
We need to stay in character.

3094
01:37:26,520 --> 01:37:27,400
I'm not scared.

3095
01:37:27,400 --> 01:37:28,520
I'm just someone who loves playing
even though I'm terrible at it.

3096
01:37:28,520 --> 01:37:28,900
(Absolutely addicted)

3097
01:37:29,760 --> 01:37:31,320
(SVIP, every Friday at noon.)
What are you pretending for?

3098
01:37:31,840 --> 01:37:33,880
(VIP, next day at noon)
I thought you were gone.

3099
01:37:34,480 --> 01:37:36,200
(Truth Supply Station, Final Opening)
Is this the final episode?

3100
01:37:36,200 --> 01:37:38,040
(SVIP, every Sunday at noon.)
It's the last time it's open.

3101
01:37:38,040 --> 01:37:39,040
(VIP, next day at noon)
The final episode.

3102
01:37:40,440 --> 01:37:42,320
(London lacks Truth's hesitation)
I can't eat more but it's the last time.

3103
01:37:42,320 --> 01:37:43,840
Fine, I'll finish it for you.

3104
01:37:45,020 --> 01:37:45,940
(Building momentum)

3105
01:37:47,560 --> 01:37:48,160
This is insanely delicious.

3106
